meta {
  name: 02. Create Presigned Upload URL (Protected)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attachments/presigned-upload
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "filename": "squad_cover.jpg",
    "type": "GROUP_COVER",
    "file_size_bytes": 2097152,
    "mime_type": "image/jpeg",
    "is_public": true
  }
}

vars:post-response {
  presignedUploadUrl: res.body.data.upload_url
  presignedObjectKey: res.body.data.object_key
}

docs {
  # Create Presigned Upload URL (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/presigned-upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Generates a temporary presigned `PUT` URL allowing the client (web or mobile) to upload the file directly to RustFS / S3 storage without routing binary payload through the application server.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `filename` | `string` | Yes | Name of the file |
  | `type` | `string` | Yes | Attachment type (e.g. `GROUP_COVER`) |
  | `file_size_bytes` | `int64` | Yes | Expected file size in bytes |
  | `mime_type` | `string` | Yes | MIME type of the file |
  | `is_public` | `boolean` | No | Whether the file should be publicly accessible |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "upload_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/group_cover/2026/11/abc123_squad_cover.jpg?X-Amz-Algorithm=...",
      "object_key": "attachments/group_cover/2026/11/abc123_squad_cover.jpg",
      "expires_in_seconds": 900
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid file type, missing required fields
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid Bearer token
  * `413 Payload Too Large` — File size exceeds limit
}
